  "summary": "Malicious code in adorn (npm)",
  "details": "The package adorn was found to contain malicious code.\n\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: amazon-inspector (2d216a470f43a6fe1d8ad3afea30e01265f3b9d2c25fc6689e296ff7c817489a)\nNo install-time or import-time behavior of concern was observed in this package version. No lifecycle scripts performing network fetch or shell execution, no reads of installer secret paths (~/.aws, ~/.ssh, ~/.npmrc), no environment-variable scraping, no hardcoded attacker-controlled network destinations, no obfuscated payloads, and no silent-relay of caller-supplied data were identified.\n",
